      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This week saw volatility amid tech sector pullbacks, with major names like AAPL and NVDA experiencing downward pressure. Treasury yields increased slightly, adding to the uncertainty in the broader market landscape. Consequently, we are maintaining a defensive posture, emphasizing portfolio stability as we navigate these economic shifts. Our focus remains on prudent risk management in this environment of fluctuating valuations.",
