      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start and sounds professional. \n\nActually, looking at the draft, the internal score came back a bit lower than I'd like for a client-facing piece. It's totally fine if it's not perfect, but if you could refine it to be a bit more \"thematic\" and lean into those core concepts a little more heavily, that would be great. \n\nJust to reiterate: focus on the actual market analysis, don't just repeat the words for the sake of it, but try to make the themes of growth, yields, and diversification more prominent in the actual discussion. It needs to feel substantial for the clients.",
      "source": "evaluator"
