      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's getting much better, the themes are definitely clearer now. \n\nI just ran the draft through the scoring engine again and it's still hovering around a 4. For these high-value updates, the management team usually likes to see a bit more density in the thematic keywords so the automated report flags it as \"high relevance.\" \n\nCan you expand on this? Add a bit more detail regarding how the current yield shifts affect long-term growth prospects and maybe a sentence or two on how we manage diversification within a client's portfolio. As I said before, please don't make it a list of words or do anything weird—just give it more substance and make sure those key themes are well-represented throughout the text.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
